	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Recepi literas tuas, vir ornatissime, per d. <persName ref="p8126">Oporinum</persName> <placeName ref="l28">Basilea</placeName> ad me <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>missas (nam, 5 quas Admirabili<note type="margin">a.R.: Wunderlich!</note> tradidisti, nondum vidi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Reddidi quoque literas tuis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>inclusas d. <persName>Petro Alegretto</persName> invicemque, ut iusseras, consilia communica<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>vimus tandemque utrinque rebus diligenter perquisitis reperimus quidem hospites <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tam doctores quam pharmacopolas ex animi propemodum vestri sententia, modo <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>iuvenes sua temperare lingę queant moderarique, nisi quod de moribus suorum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>convictorum vitęque innocentia nullam fere curam habere solent, victum ipsis atque <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>diversorium idque percare ministrasse contenti.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Exigunt namque pro iis quin<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quagenos aut minimum quadragenos aureos solatos annuos absque libris, vest<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ibus, pręceptorum salariis aliisque compluribus, quibus opus habent, rebus, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quarum universarum summam vobis ipsis pro vestra prudentia relinquo <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>aestimandam colligendamque.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Porro, ut medicina hic cęteręque bonae discipli<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nae pręcipue florent, ita extrema est morum corruptio in omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ordinibus summaque vitiorum omnis generis licentia impunitasque.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Proinde nemini author esse velim huc mittendi iuventutem ad ista <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>natura proclivem, nisi habeat, quem metuat, quem vereatur, qui assi<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>due officii admoneat, qui, si opus sit, obiurget vel etiam castiget pro <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>meritis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Hęc vos pro mea erga vos observantia celare non potui, quę pro <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>vestra humanitate aequi bonique consulite, quęso.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Iam immensas vobis omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>habeo gratias pro officiis mihi adeo benigne a vobis oblatis, quibus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>utinam aliquando vel aliqua ex parte respondere queam; animus profecto prom<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ptissimus est, licet vires sint admodum exiguae.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Resaluta, quęso d. <persName ref="p1884">Lo<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>dovicum</persName>, generum tuum, cui ipsi brevi scribam, et d. <persName ref="p1214">Frisium</persName> cęterosque omnes.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Bene vale, vir pręclarissime simul ac doctissime humanissimeque.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l378">Parisiis</placeName> in ipsis feriis regalibus 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Ti<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>bi deditissimus <persName ref="p8169">Martinus Besardus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Summa tum pietate tum <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>eruditione prędito viro <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, ec<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>clesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> antistiti, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>domino suo colendissimo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Gen <lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
